WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.586
Hello!

2
00:00:03.587 --> 00:00:05.933
Who

3
00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:09.225
are you? I'm

4
00:00:09.226 --> 00:00:12.130
a sea horse. But

5
00:00:12.131 --> 00:00:15.133
I'm not a horse. I'm

6
00:00:15.134 --> 00:00:20.622
a really small fish! Where

7
00:00:20.623 --> 00:00:23.114
do you live? Sea

8
00:00:23.115 --> 00:00:26.430
horses live in the ocean. We

9
00:00:26.431 --> 00:00:31.421
like warm water near land. What

10
00:00:31.422 --> 00:00:34.064
do you eat? Sea

11
00:00:34.065 --> 00:00:37.938
horses eat small crustaceans. We

12
00:00:37.939 --> 00:00:41.138
don't have teeth. We

13
00:00:41.139 --> 00:00:45.683
suck up food with our mouths. Who

14
00:00:45.684 --> 00:00:48.346
are your enemies? Crabs

15
00:00:48.347 --> 00:00:51.330
like to hunt us. Sometimes

16
00:00:51.331 --> 00:00:56.598
people catch us too. Do

17
00:00:56.599 --> 00:01:00.252
sea horses lay eggs? Yes.

18
00:01:00.253 --> 00:01:06.021
Females lay eggs and give them to males.

19
00:01:06.022 --> 00:01:09.351
Males carry them in a pouch.

20
00:01:09.352 --> 00:01:14.023
Finally the eggs hatch.

21
00:01:14.024 --> 00:01:16.844
Are you a good swimmer?

22
00:01:16.845 --> 00:01:21.960
No! We are the slowest fish.

23
00:01:21.961 --> 00:01:26.407
Our fins are not good for swimming.

24
00:01:26.408 --> 00:01:31.694
So sea horses don't move around much.

25
00:01:31.695 --> 00:01:37.625
You have a long tail!

26
00:01:37.626 --> 00:01:42.082
We grab plants or coral with our tails.

27
00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:49.907
This helps us stay in one place.

28
00:01:49.908 --> 00:01:53.208
Oh! I see food.

29
00:01:53.209 --> 00:01:56.295
It's time to eat.

30
00:01:56.296 --> 00:02:06.740
Good-bye, Sea Horse!

